OL,3,GNEWSABoats 'set for people smugglers'
OL,4,Aseized at airport
OL,5,
OL,6,FOfficers have seized 25 inflatable
OL,7,Fboats reportedly destined to be shipped
OL,8,Fto cross-Channel people smugglers.
OL,10,FThe National Crime Agency (NCA) said
OL,11,Fthe boats - about nine metres in length
OL,12,F- were spotted in pallets on an air
OL,13,Ffreight shipment being moved from
OL,14,FTurkey to the Netherlands.
OL,16,FThe shipment went through a freight hub
OL,17,Fat East Midlands Airport on the way,
OL,18,Fallowing NCA and Border Force to
OL,19,Fintercept on Friday.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
