OL,3,GNEWSABoats 'set for people smugglers'
OL,4,Aseized at airport
OL,5,
OL,6,FNCA officers added this was the second
OL,7,Ftime a large consignment of small boat
OL,8,Fequipment had been seized in the UK in
OL,9,F2026, but the first time such a
OL,10,Fdetection had been made in air freight.
